6-006062":{"c":"TEL","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-01-23"},"0001104659-26-048160":{"c":"TEL","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-04-24"},"0001104659-26-086509":{"c":"TEL","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-07-24"},"0001104659-26-003934":{"c":"TEL","form":"DEF 14A","filed":"2026-01-15"}},"finsights":{"TEL":[{"topic":"fcf","text":"Free cash flow was $3.4 billion in FY2026: operating cash flow of $4.5 billion less capital spending of $1.1 billion (computed from two filed figures). That is 17.1% of revenue. In FY2021 it was $2 billion.","cites":["TEL.ocf.2026","TEL.capex.2026","TEL.revenue.2026","TEL.ocf.2021","TEL.capex.2021"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $168 million in FY2026, 0.8% of revenue, against 0.6% in FY2021.","cites":["TEL.sbc.2026","TEL.revenue.2026","TEL.sbc.2021","TEL.revenue.2021"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2026 the company paid $1.9 billion to repurchase its own shares and $869 million in dividends: $2.8 billion together (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["TEL.buybacks.2026","TEL.dividends.2026"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-09-25 revenue was $5.3 billion (the fiscal year less its first nine months: computed from two filed figures), up 11.9% from $4.7 billion in the three months ended 2025-09-26.","cites":["TEL.d.revenue.2025-09-27.2026-09-25","TEL.d.revenue.2025-09-27.2026-06-26","TEL.d.revenue.2024-09-28.2025-09-26","TEL.d.revenue.2024-09-28.2025-06-27"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-09-25 revenue added up to $19.9 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $4 billion and net income to $3.3 billion.","cites":["TEL.d.revenue.2025-09-27.2025-12-26","TEL.d.revenue.2025-12-27.2026-03-27","TEL.d.revenue.2026-03-28.2026-06-26","TEL.d.revenue.2025-09-27.2026-09-25","TEL.d.revenue.2025-09-27.2026-06-26","TEL.d.opinc.2025-09-27.2025-12-26","TEL.d.opinc.2025-12-27.2026-03-27","TEL.d.opinc.2026-03-28.2026-06-26","TEL.d.opinc.2025-09-27.2026-09-25","TEL.d.opinc.2025-09-27.2026-06-26","TEL.d.netinc.2025-09-27.2025-12-26","TEL.d.netinc.2025-12-27.2026-03-27","TEL.d.netinc.2026-03-28.2026-06-26","TEL.d.netinc.2025-09-27.2026-09-25","TEL.d.netinc.2025-09-27.2026-06-26"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $3.4 billion: operating cash flow of $4.5 billion less capital spending of $1.1 billion (computed from eight filed figures).","cites":["TEL.d.ocf.2025-09-27.2025-12-26","TEL.d.ocf.2025-09-27.2026-03-27","TEL.d.ocf.2025-09-27.2026-06-26","TEL.d.ocf.2025-09-27.2026-09-25","TEL.d.capex.2025-09-27.2025-12-26","TEL.d.capex.2025-09-27.2026-03-27","TEL.d.capex.2025-09-27.2026-06-26","TEL.d.capex.2025-09-27.2026-09-25"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The proxy statement filed 2026-01-15 gives the principal executive officer’s total pay for FY2025 as $18.3 million in its summary compensation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as $66.6 million.","cites":["TEL.pay.peoTotal.2025","TEL.pay.peoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $5.3 million in total and $15.1 million actually paid.","cites":["TEL.pay.neoTotal.2025","TEL.pay.neoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $247.03 at the end of FY2025, and $288.00 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["TEL.pay.tsr.2025","TEL.pay.peerTsr.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $118 million at the end of FY2026 (tagged DeferredRevenueCurrent), against $115 million a year earlier.","cites":["TEL.deferred.2026","TEL.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 104,000 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $191,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["TEL.q.employees","TEL.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"